"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"If you haven’t already, check out our [contributing guidelines](https://github.com/Expensify/ReactNativeChat/blob/main/contributingGuides/CONTRIBUTING.md) for onboarding and email contributors@expensify.com to request to join our Slack channel!\n___\n\n**Version Number:** v9.3.31-0\n**Reproducible in staging?:** Yes\n**Reproducible in production?:** Yes\n**If this was caught during regression testing, add the test name, ID and link from BrowserStack:** https://github.com/Expensify/App/pull/78291\n**Email or phone of affected tester (no customers):** applausetester+ds@applause.expensifail.com\n**Issue reported by:** Applause Internal Team\n**Bug source:** Pull Request QA execution\n**Device used:** Mac 14.5/ Chrome\n**App Component:** Other\n\n## Action Performed:\n1. Click on the + button > Track Distance \n2. Switch to Odometer\n3. Write a number on the fields \n4. Click on the browser back\n\n## Expected Result:\nDiscard changes modal shows up, user can't go back.\n\n## Actual Result:\nDiscard changes modal doesn't shows up, user go back.\n\n## Workaround:\nUnknown\n\n## Platforms:\n- [ ] Android: App\n- [ ] Android: mWeb Chrome\n- [ ] iOS: App\n- [ ] iOS: mWeb Safari\n- [ ] iOS: mWeb Chrome\n- [ ] Windows: Chrome\n- [x] MacOS: Chrome / Safari\n\n## Screenshots/Videos\n\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/5c98d3e4-c1f3-48ca-bf48-14a887141301\n\n[View all open jobs on GitHub](https://github.com/Expensify/App/issues?q=is%3Aopen+is%3Aissue+label%3A%22Help+Wanted%22)\n\n<details><summary>Issue Owner</summary>Current Issue Owner: @mallenexpensify</details>\n<details><summary>Upwork Automation - Do Not Edit</summary>\n    <ul>\n        <li>Upwork Job URL: https://www.upwork.com/jobs/~022029450072204619790</li>\n        <li>Upwork Job ID: 2029450072204619790</li>\n        <li>Last Price Increase: 2026-03-05</li>\n    </ul>\n</details>","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Expensify/App/issues/84246/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Expensify/App/issues/84246/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null,"score":1.0},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Expensify/App/issues/76944","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Expensify/App","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Expensify/App/issues/76944/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Expensify/App/issues/76944/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Expensify/App/issues/76944/events","html_url":"https://github.com/Expensify/App/issues/76944","id":3703971376,"node_id":"I_kwDOEQqHYc7cxh4w","number":76944,"title":"[$500] Screen Reader: Many Pages: There is no dialog role and title announced","user":{"login":"nbhardwaj-del","id":242034296,"node_id":"U_kgDODm0meA","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/242034296?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/nbhardwaj-del","html_url":"https://github.com/nbhardwaj-del","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nbhardwaj-del/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nbhardwaj-del/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nbhardwaj-del/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nbhardwaj-del/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nbhardwaj-del/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nbhardwaj-del/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nbhardwaj-del/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nbhardwaj-del/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nbhardwaj-del/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":2873246102,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyODczMjQ2