31,"node_id":"U_kgDOBdJrYw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/97676131?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mkhutornyi","html_url":"https://github.com/mkhutornyi","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mkhutornyi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mkhutornyi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mkhutornyi/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mkhutornyi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mkhutornyi/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mkhutornyi/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mkhutornyi/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mkhutornyi/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mkhutornyi/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false}],"milestone":null,"comments":76,"created_at":"2025-12-07T21:01:01Z","updated_at":"2026-07-06T20:06:59Z","closed_at":null,"assignee":{"login":"amyevans","id":7277067,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcyNzcwNjc=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7277067?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/amyevans","html_url":"https://github.com/amyevans","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amyevans/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amyevans/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amyevans/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amyevans/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amyevans/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amyevans/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amyevans/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amyevans/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amyevans/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"author_association":"NONE","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"\n## Action Performed:\nPrerequisite:\n- the user is logged in\n\n1. Using JAWS + Chrome, open the page https://new.expensify.com/settings/about\n2. Navigate using TAB to the 'App download links' button and press Space to activate it.\n3. Note what is displayed and announced.\n\n## Expected Result:\nOnce the layout opens it should announce the dialog role and its visible title.\n\n## Actual Result:\nThere is no dialog role and title announced\n\nHTML:\n<div aria-label=\"App download links\" role=\"menuitem\" data-tag=\"pressable\" tabindex=\"0\" class=\"css-g5y9jx r-1otgn73 r-1loqt21 r-17gur6a r-18u37iz r-1wtj0ep r-1mmae3n r-o4dypm r-1fkl15p r-iyfy8q\" data-component=\"GenericPressable\" data-element=\"Pressable\" data-source-file=\"BaseGenericPressable.tsx\" style=\"\"><div class=\"css-g5y9jx r-13awgt0\"><div class=\"css-g5y9jx r-18u37iz\"><div class=\"css-g5y9jx r-eqz5dr r-13awgt0\"><div class=\"css-g5y9jx r-18u37iz r-105ug2t\"><div class=\"css-g5y9jx r-1awozwy r-1777fci\" style=\"width: 40px;\"><div class=\"css-g5y9jx\" data-testid=\"\"><svg xmlns=\"[http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"](http://www.w3.org/2000/svg%22) xml:space=\"preserve\" viewBox=\"0 0 20 20\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" hovered=\"false\" pressed=\"false\" fill=\"#A2A9A3\"><path d=\"M17.5 2.5c-2-2-5.1-2-7.1 0l-.4.4c-.6.6-.6 1.5 0 2.1s1.5.6 2.1 0l.4-.4c.8-.8 2-.8 2.8 0s.8 2 0 2.8l-2.8 2.8c-1 1-2.1.7-2.8 0l-2.1 2.1c1.8 1.8 4.9 2.1 7.1 0l2.8-2.8c2-1.8 2-5 0-7\"></path><path d=\"M2.7 17.4c2 2 5.1 2 7.1 0l.4-.4c.6-.6.6-1.5 0-2.1s-1.5-.6-2.1 0l-.4.4c-.8.8-2 .8-2.8 0s-.8-2 0-2.8l2.8-2.8c1-1 2.1-.7 2.8 0l2.1-2.1c-1.8-1.8-4.9-2.1-7.1 0l-2.8 2.8c-2 1.9-2 5 0 7\"></path></svg></div></div><div class=\"css-g5y9jx r-1777fci r-13awgt0\" style=\"min-height: 40px;\"><div class=\"css-g5y9jx r-18u37iz r-1awozwy r-dnmrzs\"><div dir=\"auto\" data-selection-scrapper-hidden-element=\"false\" class=\"css-146c3p1 r-1udh08x r-1udbk01 r-1iln25a\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 46, 34); font-size: 15px; text-align: left; font-family: &quot;Expensify Neue&quot;, &quot;Windows Segoe UI Emoji&quot;, &quot;Noto Color Emoji&quot;, &quot;Custom Emoji Font&quot;; font-style: normal; font-weight: 700; flex-shrink: 1; margin-left: 12px; white-space: pre; direction: ltr; max-width: 100%; line-height: 20px;\">App download links</div></div></div></div></div><div class=\"css-g5y9jx r-18u37iz\" style=\"min-height: 40px;\"><div class=\"css-g5y9jx r-105ug2t\" style=\"justify-content: center; align-items: center; width: 40px;\"><div class=\"css-g5y9jx\" data-testid=\"\"><svg xmlns=\"[http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"](http://www.w3.org/2000/svg%22) xml:space=\"preserve\" viewBox=\"0 0 20 20\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" hovered=\"false\" pressed=\"false\" fill=\"#A2A9A3\"><path d=\"M5.6 18.4c.8.8 2 .8 2.8 0l8.4-8.4-8.4-8.4c-.8-.8-2-.8-2.8 0s-.8 2 0 2.8l5.6 5.6-5.6 5.6c-.8.8-.8 2 0 2.8\" style=\"fill-rule: evenodd; clip-rule: evenodd;\"></path></svg></div></div></div></div></div></div>\n\n## Area issue was found in:\nSettings-About\n\n## Failed WCAG checkpoints\nWCAG 4.1.2 Name, Role, Value\nhttps://www.w3.org/WAI/WCAG22/Understanding/name-role-value\n\n## User impact:\nProviding role, state, and value information on all user interface components enables compatibility with assistive technology, such as screen readers, screen magnifiers, and speech recognition software, used by people with disabilities.\n\n## Suggested resolution:\nImplement an accessible dialog to announce the dialog role. Use the aria-labelledby to associate the dialog with its visible name to announce it when opening the layout.\nhttps://www.w3.org/WAI/ARIA/apg/patterns/dialog-modal/\n\n## Environment(s)\nWindows Windows 10 - Chrome\n\n## Screenshots/Videos\n<img width=\"1917\" height=\"1004\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/33b656a4-804e-408b-8ffd-f6894201f9dd\" />\n\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/ddf72c96-0221-4c73-9a18-3ee433248da0\n\n\n**Version Number:** NA\n**Reproducible in staging?:** NA\n**Reproducible in production?:** Yes\n**Email or phone of affected tester (no customers):** NA\n**Logs:** https://stackoverflow.com/c/expensify/questions/4856 NA\n**Notes/Photos/Videos:** Any additional supporting documentation Yes\n**Expensify/Expensify Issue URL:** https://platform.applause.com/company/12102/products/36605/community-issues/6997205\n**Issue reported by:** NA\n**Slack conversation:** NA\n\n\n<details><summary>Upwork Automation - Do Not Edit</summary>\n    <ul>\n        <li>Upwork Job URL: https://www.upwork.com/jobs/~022009685418786153962</li>\n        <li>Upwork Job ID: 2009685418786153962</li>\n        <li>Last Price Increase: 2026-01-28</li>\n    </ul>\n</details>\n\n<details><summary>Issue Owner</summary>Current Issue Owner: @mkhutornyi</details>","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Expensify/App/issues/76944/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Expensify/App/issues/76944/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"reopened","pinned_comment":null,"score":1.0},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tinygrad/tinygrad/issues/3039","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tinygrad/tinygrad","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tinygrad/tinygrad/issues/3039/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tinygrad/tinygrad/issues/3039/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tinygrad/tinygrad/issues/3039/events","html_url":"https://github.com/tinygrad/tinygrad/issues/3039","id":2069553289,"node_id":"I_kwDOEjAjqs57WuCJ","number":3039,"title":"Bounty: Fast parallel scan (Mamba, etc). ","user":{"login":"Algomancer","id":13579432,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEzNTc5NDMy","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/13579432?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Algomancer","html_url":"https://github.com/Algomancer","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Algomancer/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Algomancer/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Algomancer/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Algomancer/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Algomancer/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Algomancer/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Algomancer/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Algomancer/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Algomancer/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":5546470278,"node_id":"LA_kwDOEjAjqs8AAAABSphrhg","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tinygrad/tinygrad/labels/bounty","name":"bounty","color":"0E8A16","default":false,"description":"Active Bounty"}],"state":"open","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":17,"created_at":"2024-01-08T03:26:27Z","updated_at":"2026-07-06T19:16:55Z","closed_at":null,"assignee":null,"author_association":"NONE","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"It would be great to have a general parallel prefix sum (associative scan) operation in tinygrad, something like [associative_scan](https://jax.readthedocs.io/en/latest/_autosummary/jax.lax.associative_scan.html) in JAX or [scan_associative](https://www.tensorflow.org/probability/api_docs/python/tfp/math/scan_associative) in TensorFlow Probability. This operation is key for the parallelization of some algorithms in CRFs, [filtering/smoothing in state space models](https://github.com/EEA-sensors/sequential-parallelization-examples/blob/main/python/temporal-parallelization-bayes-smoothers/parallel_kalman_jax.ipynb), mamba etc.\r\n\r\nAdditional Reference\r\n\r\nhttps://arxiv.org/abs/2311.06281\r\n---\r\n\r\nCurrent Bounty: $500\r\nTo lock the bounty submit a draft PR with a decent amount of progress made\r\nMake sure to reference this issue in the PR for future tracking\r\n\r\nNotice: If the PR goes stale the bounty will be unlocked\r\n","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tinygrad/tinygrad/issues/3039/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tinygrad/tinygrad/issues/3039/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null,"score":1.0},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/398","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/398/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/398/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/398/events","html_url":"https://github.com/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/398","id":3974807149,"node_id":"I_kwDORGgqa87s6r5t","number":398,"title":"[QUEST] Harden the Chain — Security Quest, 67 RTC Total","user":{"login":"Scottcjn","id":121303252,"node_id":"U_kgDOBzrw1A","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/121303252?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn","html_url":"https://github.com/Scottcjn","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":10115035859,"node_id":"LA_kwDORGgqa88AAAACWucy0w","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/labels/bounty","name":"bounty","color":"0E8A16","default":false,"description":"RTC-paid bounty"}],"state":"open","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":65,"created_at":"2026-02-22T15:25:06Z","updated_at":"2026-07-06T19:04:22Z","closed_at":null,"assignee":null,"author_association":"OWNER","active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"## Quest Chain: Harden the Chain\n\nFor security-minded contributors. Complete each step to earn up to **100 RTC** and the **Guardian** title.\n\n---\n\n### Step 1: Read the Architecture (10 RTC)\nRead the codebase and write a 500+ word security assessment covering:\n- How attestation works (the \\`/attest/submit\\` flow)\n- How hardware fingerprinting prevents VM farms\n- How epoch rewards are calculated and distributed\n- One potential attack vector you identified\n\n**Prove it:** Post your assessment as a comment or gist link.\n\n---\n\n### Step 2: Reproduce a Known Fix (15 RTC)\nPick one vulnerability from BuilderFred's audit (all 6 are fixed):\n1. VM Fingerprint Bypass\n2. Antiquity Spoofing\n3. Mock Signature Mode\n4. Inline PubKey Hijack\n5. SQL Schema Mismatch\n6. Hardware Binding Bypass\n\nSet up a local test environment and demonstrate you understand HOW the fix works by:\n- Describing the attack before the fix\n- Showing the fix in the code\n- Explaining why the fix is sufficient (or isn't)\n\n**Prove it:** Write-up with code references.\n\n---\n\n### Step 3: Find Something New (75 RTC)\nFind and report a previously unknown security issue. Must include:\n- Clear description of the vulnerability\n- Steps to reproduce\n- Severity assessment (Critical/High/Medium/Low)\n- Suggested fix\n\n**Prove it:** File a responsible disclosure via the SECURITY.md process. If confirmed, earn the full 75 RTC + Guardian title.\n\n---\n\n### Completion\n\n| Steps | Reward | Title |\n|-------|--------|-------|\n| Step 1 only | 10 RTC | Security Explorer |\n| Steps 1 + 2 | 25 RTC | Security Analyst |\n| Steps 1 + 2 + 3 | **100 RTC** | **Guardian** |\n\n*You don't have to find a new vulnerability to earn from Steps 1 and 2. Those reward understanding, not just discovery.*","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/398/reactions","total_count":6,"+1":2,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":1,"confused":0,"heart":1,"rocket":1,"eyes":1},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/398/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null,"score":1.0},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/asyncapi/website/issues/3186","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/asyncapi/website","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/asyncapi/website/issues/3186/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/asyncapi/website/issues/3186/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/asyncapi/website/issues/3186/events","html_url":"https://github.com/asyncapi/website/issues/3186","id":2501479656,"node_id":"I_kwDOBW5R_c6VGYzo","number":3186,"title":"[FEATURE] Performance + Accessibility Improvement of website","user":{"login":"akshatnema","id":76521428,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc2NTIxNDI4","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/76521428?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/akshatnema","html_url":"https://github.com/akshatnema","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akshatnema/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akshatnema/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akshatnema/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akshatnema/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akshatnema/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akshatnema/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akshatnema/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akshatnema/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akshatnema/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":603919132,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw2MDM5MTkxMzI=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/asyncapi/website/labels/enhancement","name":"enhancement","color":"84b6eb","default":true,"description":null},{"id":1907431320,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwxOTA3NDMxMzIw","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/asyncapi/website/labels/Epic","name":"Epic","color":"3E4B9E","default":false,"description":null},{"id":5407684713,"node_id":"LA_kwDOBW5R_c8AAAABQlK4aQ","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/asyncapi/website/labels/bounty","name":"bounty","color":"0e8a16","default":false,"description":"AsyncAPI Bounty program related label"}],"state":"open","locked":false,"assignees":[{"login":"patilpratik1905","id":153302730,"node_id":"U_kgDOCSM2yg","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/153302730?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/patilpratik1905","html_url":"https://github.com/patilpratik1905","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/patilpratik1905/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/patilpratik1905/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/patilpratik1905/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/patilpratik1905/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/patilpratik1905/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/patilpratik1905/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/patilpratik1905/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/patilpratik1905/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/patilpratik1905/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false}],"milestone":null,"comments":53,"created_at":"2024-09-02T19:07:32Z","updated_at":"2026-07-06T18:30:54Z","closed_at":null,"assignee":{"login":"patilpratik1905","id":153302730,"node_id":"U_kgDOCSM2yg","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/153302730?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/patilpratik1905","html_url":"https://github.com/patilpratik1905","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/patilpratik1905/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/patilpratik1905/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/patilpratik1905/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/patilpratik1905/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/patilpratik1905/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/patilpratik1905/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/patilpratik1905/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/patilpratik1905/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/patilpratik1905/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"author_association":"MEMBER","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Why do we need this improvement?\n\nWith the addition of multiple components, pages and MD files, it's now important for us, to make the website efficient for all web + mobile users. Currently, the performance of the website has critically low numbers in both web and mobile view, which can impact the efficiency and user views in the website. \r\n\r\nOn the other hand, it's also important that we add the necessary accessibility labels to the website. Currently, with the addition of many new illustrations, we have not added label elements for these tags.\n\n### How will this change help?\n\nThe performance improvement will help the website render the contents more efficiently to the users and will drastically enhance lighthouse key metrics.\n\n### Screenshots\n\nSome screenshots of lighthouse reports:\r\n<img width=\"638\" alt=\"image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/acfee5f2-bdf5-477e-92c9-92ee585ef731\">\r\n\r\n\n\n### How could it be implemented/designed?\n\nFollowing tasks need to be done in this issue:\r\n\r\n- [ ] Make proper research + analysis on what needs to be fixed to improve performance in both mobile + web view.\r\n- [ ] Propose the solution to improve the performance of website, at least 95% on each page.\r\n- [ ] Search for the elements that require labels to improve accessibility.\r\n- [ ] Create a workflow to analyse lighthouse reports for each page (not docs, blogs or any mdx rendered page0\n\n### 🚧 Breaking changes\n\nYes\n\n### 👀 Have you checked for similar open issues?\n\n- [X] I checked and didn't find a similar issue\n\n### 🏢 Have you read the Contributing Guidelines?\n\n- [X] I have read the [Contributing Guidelines](https://github.com/asyncapi/.github/blob/master/CONTRIBUTING.md)\n\n### Are you willing to work on this issue?\n\nNone","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/asyncapi/website/issues/3186/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":1},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/asyncapi/website/issues/3186/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null,"score":1.0},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/374","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/374/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/374/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/374/events","html_url":"https://github.com/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/374","id":3968422014,"node_id":"I_kwDORGgqa87siVB-","number":374,"title":"[BOUNTY] First Attest Bonus (Latest Miner Required) - 3 RTC","user":{"login":"sophiaeagent-beep","id":245112282,"node_id":"U_kgDODpwd2g","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/245112282?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/sophiaeagent-beep","html_url":"https://github.com/sophiaeagent-beep","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sophiaeagent-beep/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sophiaeagent-beep/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sophiaeagent-beep/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sophiaeagent-beep/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sophiaeagent-beep/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sophiaeagent-beep/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sophiaeagent-beep/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sophiaeagent-beep/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sophiaeagent-beep/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":10115035859,"node_id":"LA_kwDORGgqa88AAAACWucy0w","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/labels/bounty","name":"bounty","color":"0E8A16","default":false,"description":"RTC-paid bounty"},{"id":10115035877,"node_id":"LA_kwDORGgqa88AAAACWucy5Q","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/labels/open","name":"open","color":"1D76DB","default":false,"description":"Open for claims"},{"id":10115035905,"node_id":"LA_kwDORGgqa88AAAACWuczAQ","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/labels/micro","name":"micro","color":"BFD4F2","default":false,"description":"1-10 RTC"},{"id":10115035997,"node_id":"LA_kwDORGgqa88AAAACWuczXQ","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/labels/multi-claim","name":"multi-claim","color":"FBCA04","default":false,"description":"Multiple agents can claim"},{"id":10119173681,"node_id":"LA_kwDORGgqa88AAAACWyZWMQ","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/labels/propagation","name":"propagation","color":"2EA44F","default":false,"description":"Network growth"},{"id":10153071106,"node_id":"LA_kwDORGgqa88AAAACXSuSAg","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/labels/community","name":"community","color":"5319E7","default":false,"description":"Community engagement"}],"state":"open","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":33,"created_at":"2026-02-20T12:51:41Z","updated_at":"2026-07-06T17:57:06Z","closed_at":null,"assignee":null,"author_association":"OWNER","active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"## [BOUNTY] First Attest Bonus (Latest Miner Required)\n\nWe want more real miners online. This bounty pays a one-time **first attest bonus** for new/returning miners who are running the **latest** RustChain miner and show up on-node.\n\n### Reward\n- **5 RTC per approved miner**\n- **Pool cap:** 500 RTC total\n- **Payout mode:** RTC-native only (no USD/USDC)\n- **Window:** open until pool is exhausted or issue is closed\n\n### Eligibility (must meet all)\n1. Run the latest miner from `main` in `Scottcjn/Rustchain`.\n2. Miner must appear in `GET /api/miners` on the primary node.\n3. Miner must be on real hardware (no VM/emulator abuse).\n4. Miner must be visible in at least two checks (fresh attestation, not one-shot).\n5. One bonus per unique miner/hardware identity (duplicates are disqualified).\n\n### Quick Start\n```bash\ngit clone https://github.com/Scottcjn/Rustchain.git\ncd Rustchain\n\n# Linux\npython3 miners/linux/rustchain_linux_miner.py --wallet YOUR_MINER_ID\n\n# Verify\ncurl -sk https://50.28.86.131/health\ncurl -sk https://50.28.86.131/api/miners\ncurl -sk \"https://50.28.86.131/wallet/balance?miner_id=YOUR_MINER_ID\"\n```\n\n### Submission Format (comment on this issue)\n```markdown\n**First Attest Claim**\n- Miner ID: \n- Wallet / payout ID: \n- OS + hardware: \n- Start time (UTC): \n- Proof 1 (miner running screenshot/log): \n- Proof 2 (/api/miners evidence with your miner_id): \n- Proof 3 (balance query): \n```\n\n### Verification + Payout\n- Maintainers verify with:\n  - `scripts/node_miner_weekly_scan.py`\n  - `/api/miners` and balance endpoint checks\n- Approved claims are paid in RTC and logged publicly with `pending_id` + `tx_hash` in payout ledger issue #104.\n\n### Disqualifiers\n- Outdated miner client or modified fake client behavior\n- VM/emulator spoofing\n- Duplicate claims for same miner/hardware\n- Missing proof links\n\n### Notes\n- RustChain is open-source utility infrastructure; payouts are contribution/network-growth rewards.\n- No promise of token price/value is made or implied.\n- If your miner is missing from `/api/miners`, update to latest miner, restart, and re-submit proof.\n\nNode hosts also welcome. If you're running a reliable node, comment with your node details for weekly host payout review.\n","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/374/reactions","total_count":6,"+1":2,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":1,"confused":0,"heart":1,"rocket":1,"eyes":1},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/374/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null,"score":1.0},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/422","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/422/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/422/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/422/events","html_url":"https://github.com/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/422","id":3986863483,"node_id":"I_kwDORGgqa87torV7","number":422,"title":"[BOUNTY] Register Your Agent on Beacon Atlas - 3 RTC","user":{"login":"Scottcjn","id":121303252,"node_id":"U_kgDOBzrw1A","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/121303252?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn","html_url":"https://github.com/Scottcjn","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":10115029422,"node_id":"LA_kwDORGgqa88AAAACWucZrg","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/labels/help%20wanted","name":"help wanted","color":"008672","default":true,"description":"Extra attention is needed"},{"id":10115029430,"node_id":"LA_kwDORGgqa88AAAACWucZtg","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/labels/good%20first%20issue","name":"good first issue","color":"7057ff","default":true,"description":"Good for newcomers"},{"id":10115035859,"node_id":"LA_kwDORGgqa88AAAACWucy0w","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/labels/bounty","name":"bounty","color":"0E8A16","default":false,"description":"RTC-paid bounty"}],"state":"open","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":58,"created_at":"2026-02-25T02:44:28Z","updated_at":"2026-07-06T17:57:05Z","closed_at":null,"assignee":null,"author_association":"OWNER","active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"## Bounty: Register Your Agent on Beacon Atlas (5 RTC)\n\n**Difficulty**: Easy-Medium | **Time**: 20 minutes | **RTC**: 5\n\nRegister an agent on the Beacon Atlas - RustChain's agent discovery network.\n\n### What is Beacon Atlas?\n- Live map: https://rustchain.org/beacon/\n- 31+ registered agents communicating via signed envelopes\n- Think DNS for AI agents\n\n### Steps\n1. `pip install beacon-skill`\n2. `beacon identity new && beacon identity show`\n3. Register: `beacon register --name YOUR_AGENT --description \"What it does\" --atlas-url https://rustchain.org/beacon/api/relay/register`\n4. Send hello: `beacon webhook send https://rustchain.org/beacon/api/relay/receive --kind hello --text \"Hello from MY_AGENT\"`\n5. Verify: `curl -s https://rustchain.org/beacon/api/relay/discover | python3 -m json.tool | grep YOUR_AGENT`\n\n### Requirements\n- Real name and description (not \"test\" or \"asdf\")\n- At least 1 signed envelope sent\n- One registration per person\n\n### How to Claim\nComment with: Agent ID (bcn_...), Agent name, Atlas verification, Envelope proof, RTC wallet\n\n### Pool\n- **5 RTC per agent** | **Pool cap: 250 RTC** (50 registrations)\n\n### Bonus: Keep Agent Alive (+3 RTC)\nRun `beacon loop --interval 60` for 24+ hours. Show last-seen timestamp as proof.\n\n### What counts as an Agent?\nAnything that sends/receives messages: chatbot, monitor script, Discord bot, cron job, experimental AI project.\n\n---\n### 📌 One agent per operator (enforced)\nRegistering multiple agent IDs from the same operator / GitHub account does **not** multiply this bounty — **only one registration per operator is payable.** Verification is done against the authoritative Beacon Atlas profile (`rustchain.org/beacon/agent/<id>`); a real agent returns a full profile, a fabricated ID 404s. Pasted register/heartbeat JSON alone is not sufficient proof.","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/422/reactions","total_count":6,"+1":2,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":1,"confused":0,"heart":1,"rocket":1,"eyes":1},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/422/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null,"score":1.0},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/249","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/249/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/249/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/249/events","html_url":"https://github.com/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/249","id":3950113827,"node_id":"I_kwDORGgqa87rcfQj","number":249,"title":"[BOUNTY] RustChain Telegram Community Bot (33 RTC)","user":{"login":"Scottcjn","id":121303252,"node_id":"U_kgDOBzrw1A","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/121303252?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn","html_url":"https://github.com/Scottcjn","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":10115035859,"node_id":"LA_kwDORGgqa88AAAACWucy0w","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/labels/bounty","name":"bounty","color":"0E8A16","default":false,"description":"RTC-paid bounty"},{"id":10115035877,"node_id":"LA_kwDORGgqa88AAAACWucy5Q","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/labels/open","name":"open","color":"1D76DB","default":false,"description":"Open for claims"},{"id":10119175842,"node_id":"LA_kwDORGgqa88AAAACWyZeog","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/labels/ecosystem","name":"ecosystem","color":"7B5EA7","default":false,"description":"Integrations & exchange listings"},{"id":10153071106,"node_id":"LA_kwDORGgqa88AAAACXSuSAg","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/labels/community","name":"community","color":"5319E7","default":false,"description":"Community engagement"}],"state":"open","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":36,"created_at":"2026-02-17T00:20:10Z","updated_at":"2026-07-06T17:55:06Z","closed_at":null,"assignee":null,"author_association":"OWNER","active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"## RustChain Telegram Community Bot\n\n**Reward: 50 RTC**\n\n### What To Build\nA Telegram bot for a RustChain community group that provides:\n- `/price` — Current wRTC price from Raydium\n- `/miners` — Active miner count from `/api/miners`\n- `/epoch` — Current epoch info from `/epoch`\n- `/balance <wallet>` — Check RTC balance\n- `/health` — Node health status\n\n### Requirements\n- Python (python-telegram-bot or aiogram)\n- Must use real RustChain API endpoints (50.28.86.131)\n- Include setup instructions and requirements.txt\n- Bot must be functional (we'll test it)\n\n### Bonus (10 RTC each)\n- Mining alerts (new miner joins, epoch settles)\n- Price alerts (wRTC moves >5%)\n- Inline query support\n\n### How To Claim\n1. Submit PR to Scottcjn/Rustchain with bot code in `tools/telegram_bot/`\n2. Include deployment instructions\n3. Reply here with PR link + wallet name\n\n> API docs: https://github.com/Scottcjn/Rustchain/blob/main/docs/api/REFERENCE.md","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/249/reactions","total_count":3,"+1":2,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":1,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/249/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null,"score":1.0},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/400","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/400/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/400/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/400/events","html_url":"https://github.com/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/400","id":3974810641,"node_id":"I_kwDORGgqa87s6swR","number":400,"title":"[SEASON 1] Harden the Forge — Security Season (750 RTC Pool, 6 Weeks)","user":{"login":"Scottcjn","id":121303252,"node_id":"U_kgDOBzrw1A","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/121303252?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn","html_url":"https://github.com/Scottcjn","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":10115035859,"node_id":"LA_kwDORGgqa88AAAACWucy0w","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/labels/bounty","name":"bounty","color":"0E8A16","default":false,"description":"RTC-paid bounty"}],"state":"open","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":22,"created_at":"2026-02-22T15:26:17Z","updated_at":"2026-07-06T17:54:13Z","closed_at":null,"assignee":null,"author_association":"OWNER","active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"## Season 1: Harden the Forge\n\n**Duration**: Feb 22 - Apr 5, 2026 (6 weeks)\n**Theme**: Security hardening, edge case discovery, attack surface reduction\n**Total Pool**: 750 RTC\n**Leaderboard**: Updated weekly in this issue\n\n---\n\n### Season Bounties\n\n| Issue | Challenge | Reward | Difficulty |\n|-------|-----------|--------|-----------|\n| [#54](https://github.com/Scottcjn/Rustchain/issues/54) | Ledger Integrity Audit | 200 RTC | Hard |\n| [#56](https://github.com/Scottcjn/Rustchain/issues/56) | Epoch Settlement Testing | 150 RTC | Hard |\n| [#57](https://github.com/Scottcjn/Rustchain/issues/57) | API Auth Hardening | 100 RTC | Medium |\n| [#58](https://github.com/Scottcjn/Rustchain/issues/58) | Consensus Attack Vectors | 200 RTC | Hard |\n| [#59](https://github.com/Scottcjn/Rustchain/issues/59) | Pending Transfer Edge Cases | 150 RTC | Medium |\n| [#60](https://github.com/Scottcjn/Rustchain/issues/60) | Ergo Anchor Integrity | 100 RTC | Medium |\n| [#398](#398) | Security Quest Chain | 100 RTC | Progressive |\n\n### Plus: Any NEW vulnerability discovered during the season earns bonus RTC on top of the standard bounty.\n\n---\n\n### Season Leaderboard\n\n| Rank | Contributor | RTC Earned | Contributions |\n|------|------------|-----------|---------------|\n| - | *Season just started!* | - | - |\n\n*Updated every Saturday. Top contributor at season end gets a **250 RTC Grand Prize** bonus.*\n\n---\n\n### How to Participate\n\n1. Pick a bounty from the table above\n2. Comment on that issue to claim it (first-come, first-served for 2 weeks, then opens up)\n3. Submit your PR or report\n4. Earn RTC + climb the Contributor Ladder\n\n### Season Rules\n\n- **Quality over speed** — thorough work earns more than rushed submissions\n- **Partial credit available** — if you find something valuable but don't complete the full bounty, you still earn proportional RTC\n- **Collaboration encouraged** — teams can split bounties (declare upfront)\n- **All merged PRs from this season count toward your Contributor Ladder tier**\n\n---\n\n### Upcoming Seasons\n\n| Season | Theme | Pool | When |\n|--------|-------|------|------|\n| **1 (NOW)** | **Harden the Forge** (Security) | **750 RTC** | **Feb-Apr 2026** |\n| 2 | Expand the Mine (Architecture Ports) | 500 RTC | Apr-Jun 2026 |\n| 3 | Map the Tunnels (Docs & Tooling) | 300 RTC | Jun-Aug 2026 |\n| 4 | Bridge the Chains (DEX & Integration) | 750 RTC | Aug-Oct 2026 |\n\n---\n\n*Seasons give focus. Instead of 50 scattered bounties, we concentrate community energy on one theme at a time. This is how we build a secure, battle-tested blockchain.*","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/400/reactions","total_count":3,"+1":2,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":1,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/400/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null,"score":1.0},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/66","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/66/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/66/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/66/events","html_url":"https://github.com/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/66","id":3904273917,"node_id":"I_kwDORGgqa87otn39","number":66,"title":"[BOUNTY] 🔴 Red Team: x402 Payment Protocol Exploits (100 RTC)","user":{"login":"Scottcjn","id":121303252,"node_id":"U_kgDOBzrw1A","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/121303252?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn","html_url":"https://github.com/Scottcjn","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":10115035859,"node_id":"LA_kwDORGgqa88AAAACWucy0w","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/labels/bounty","name":"bounty","color":"0E8A16","default":false,"description":"RTC-paid bounty"},{"id":10115035877,"node_id":"LA_kwDORGgqa88AAAACWucy5Q","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/labels/open","name":"open","color":"1D76DB","default":false,"description":"Open for claims"},{"id":10119173301,"node_id":"LA_kwDORGgqa88AAAACWyZUtQ","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/labels/red-team","name":"red-team","color":"D93F0B","default":false,"description":"Adversarial security testing"},{"id":10119173491,"node_id":"LA_kwDORGgqa88AAAACWyZVcw","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/labels/hardening","name":"hardening","color":"0052CC","default":false,"description":"Security improvements"}],"state":"open","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":88,"created_at":"2026-02-06T01:03:30Z","updated_at":"2026-07-06T17:51:30Z","closed_at":null,"assignee":null,"author_association":"OWNER","active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"## Red Team Bounty: x402 Payment Protocol Exploits\n\n**Reward: 100 RTC** (~$10 at reference rate)\n\n### Target\nThe x402/8004 HTTP Payment Protocol implementation merged in Rustchain PR #5 by @erdogan98.\n\n**Code location:** `x402/` directory in Rustchain repo\n\n### What to Attack\n\n1. **Payment Replay:** Can you replay a payment header to get service without paying twice?\n2. **Amount Manipulation:** Can you modify payment amount after signing?\n3. **Receipt Forgery:** Can you forge a valid payment receipt?\n4. **Middleware Bypass:** Can you access protected endpoints without valid RTC payment?\n5. **Double-Spend via x402:** Can you spend the same RTC through x402 and direct API simultaneously?\n6. **Client Impersonation:** Can you use someone else's payment credentials?\n\n### Rules\n- Document each vulnerability with reproduction steps\n- Classify severity (Critical/High/Medium/Low)\n- Suggest fix for each finding\n- Do NOT exploit against production — test locally or on a test node\n- Responsible disclosure: report here first, don't publicize until fixed\n\n### Payout Scale\n| Severity | Bonus |\n|----------|-------|\n| Critical (fund drain) | +100 RTC |\n| High (auth bypass) | +50 RTC |\n| Medium (info leak) | +25 RTC |\n| Low (edge case) | Base 100 RTC |\n\n### Deliverables\n- Security report with PoC for each finding\n- Suggested fixes\n- PR with patches (bonus RTC)\n\n### Claiming\nComment with your security testing background.","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/66/reactions","total_count":9,"+1":3,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":1,"confused":0,"heart":2,"rocket":2,"eyes":1},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/66/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null,"score":1.0},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/58","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/58/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/58/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/58/events","html_url":"https://github.com/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/58","id":3893861852,"node_id":"I_kwDORGgqa87oF53c","number":58,"title":"[BOUNTY] 🔴 Red Team: Cross-Node Consensus Attacks (100 RTC)","user":{"login":"Scottcjn","id":121303252,"node_id":"U_kgDOBzrw1A","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/121303252?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn","html_url":"https://github.com/Scottcjn","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":10115035859,"node_id":"LA_kwDORGgqa88AAAACWucy0w","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/labels/bounty","name":"bounty","color":"0E8A16","default":false,"description":"RTC-paid bounty"},{"id":10115035877,"node_id":"LA_kwDORGgqa88AAAACWucy5Q","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/labels/open","name":"open","color":"1D76DB","default":false,"description":"Open for claims"},{"id":10119173301,"node_id":"LA_kwDORGgqa88AAAACWyZUtQ","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/labels/red-team","name":"red-team","color":"D93F0B","default":false,"description":"Adversarial security testing"},{"id":10119173491,"node_id":"LA_kwDORGgqa88AAAACWyZVcw","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/labels/hardening","name":"hardening","color":"0052CC","default":false,"description":"Security improvements"}],"state":"open","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":97,"created_at":"2026-02-04T00:20:49Z","updated_at":"2026-07-06T17:50:30Z","closed_at":null,"assignee":null,"author_association":"OWNER","active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"## 🔴 Red Team Bounty — Consensus & Replication Attacks\n\n**Bounty: 200 RTC (~$20)**\n\n### Target\n\nRustChain runs 3 attestation nodes that should maintain consensus. Can you break it?\n\n### Attack Vectors to Test\n\n1. **Split Brain** — Can you make nodes disagree on balances/state?\n2. **Replay Across Nodes** — Replay valid attestation to different node?\n3. **Database Desync** — Force nodes out of sync?\n4. **Eclipse Attack** — Isolate a node and feed it false data?\n5. **Time Manipulation** — Exploit clock differences between nodes?\n\n### Node Addresses\n\n```\nNode 1: 50.28.86.131 (Primary)\nNode 2: 50.28.86.153 (Ergo Anchor)\nNode 3: 76.8.228.245:8099 (External)\n```\n\n### Deliverable\n\n- Attack methodology\n- Evidence of consensus break (screenshots, logs)\n- Impact assessment\n- Recommended mitigations\n\n### Rules\n\n- Do NOT permanently damage node state\n- Responsible disclosure\n- Document everything\n\n**200 RTC** for valid consensus attacks. Critical findings may earn bonus.","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/58/reactions","total_count":4,"+1":2,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":1,"eyes":1},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/58/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null,"score":1.0},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/1113","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/1113/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/1113/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/1113/events","html_url":"https://github.com/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/1113","id":4039065148,"node_id":"I_kwDORGgqa87wvz48","number":1113,"title":"[BOUNTY: 5 RTC] RTC Token Distribution Analysis","user":{"login":"Scottcjn","id":121303252,"node_id":"U_kgDOBzrw1A","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/121303252?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn","html_url":"https://github.com/Scottcjn","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":10115035859,"node_id":"LA_kwDORGgqa88AAAACWucy0w","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/labels/bounty","name":"bounty","color":"0E8A16","default":false,"description":"RTC-paid bounty"},{"id":10369510790,"node_id":"LA_kwDORGgqa88AAAACahIthg","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/labels/research","name":"research","color":"ededed","default":false,"description":null}],"state":"open","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":51,"created_at":"2026-03-07T18:00:34Z","updated_at":"2026-07-06T17:46:42Z","closed_at":null,"assignee":null,"author_association":"OWNER","active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"## Token Distribution Analysis\n\nAnalyze the RustChain wallet distribution using the explorer API.\n\n### Requirements\n- Query all wallet balances from the API\n- Calculate Gini coefficient\n- Show top 10 holders (excluding founder wallets)\n- Chart the distribution (histogram or Lorenz curve)\n- Compare to other small-cap crypto distributions\n\n### Reward: 8 RTC\nAlso available as RIP-302 agent job.","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/1113/reactions","total_count":4,"+1":2,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":1,"eyes":1},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/1113/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null,"score":1.0},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/397","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/397/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/397/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/397/events","html_url":"https://github.com/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/397","id":3974806452,"node_id":"I_kwDORGgqa87s6ru0","number":397,"title":"[QUEST] Become a RustChain Miner — 5 Steps, 50 RTC Total","user":{"login":"Scottcjn","id":121303252,"node_id":"U_kgDOBzrw1A","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/121303252?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn","html_url":"https://github.com/Scottcjn","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":10115035859,"node_id":"LA_kwDORGgqa88AAAACWucy0w","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/labels/bounty","name":"bounty","color":"0E8A16","default":false,"description":"RTC-paid bounty"}],"state":"open","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":16,"created_at":"2026-02-22T15:24:52Z","updated_at":"2026-07-06T17:45:42Z","closed_at":null,"assignee":null,"author_association":"OWNER","active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"## Quest Chain: Become a RustChain Miner\n\nComplete each step in order. Each step unlocks the next. **50 RTC total** for completing the full chain.\n\n---\n\n### Step 1: Install and Run (5 RTC)\n\\`\\`\\`bash\npip install clawrtc\nclawrtc mine --wallet YOUR_NAME --dry-run\n\\`\\`\\`\n**Prove it:** Screenshot or paste your \\`--dry-run\\` output showing your hardware fingerprint.\n\n---\n\n### Step 2: Mine Your First Block (10 RTC)\n\\`\\`\\`bash\nclawrtc mine --wallet YOUR_NAME\n\\`\\`\\`\nRun the miner for at least 1 hour on real hardware (not a VM — our fingerprinting will detect it).\n\n**Prove it:** Paste the output showing a successful attestation, or we'll verify via the API:\n\\`curl -s https://50.28.86.131/api/miners | python3 -m json.tool\\`\n\n---\n\n### Step 3: Understand the Consensus (10 RTC)\nRead the RIP-200 documentation and answer these 3 questions in a comment:\n1. Why does a PowerPC G4 earn more RTC than a modern x86 CPU?\n2. What are the 6 hardware fingerprint checks that prevent VM farming?\n3. What is the current epoch reward pot and how is it distributed?\n\n**No copying from docs** — explain in your own words. We can tell.\n\n---\n\n### Step 4: Port or Improve (15 RTC)\nDo ONE of the following:\n- **Port the miner** to a new platform (Raspberry Pi, RISC-V, old laptop, etc.) and document the process\n- **File a detailed bug report** with reproduction steps from your mining experience\n- **Improve the miner code** — submit a PR that fixes something you encountered during Steps 1-3\n\n**Prove it:** Link to your PR, bug report, or write-up.\n\n---\n\n### Step 5: Teach Someone Else (10 RTC)\nWrite a tutorial, blog post, or video showing someone else how to mine RustChain. Publish it on Dev.to, Medium, YouTube, or your personal blog.\n\n**Prove it:** Link to your published content. Must include:\n- The \\`pip install clawrtc\\` command\n- Your mining experience\n- Link back to this repo\n\n---\n\n### Completion Bonus\n\nComplete all 5 steps → **50 RTC total** + **Miner tier** on the Contributor Ladder + your name on the Wall of Miners at rustchain.org.\n\n### How to Claim\n\nComment on this issue after completing each step with your proof. We verify and pay per step. You don't have to complete all 5 at once — take your time.\n\n\\`\\`\\`\nStep completed: 1\nProof: [screenshot/link/paste]\nRTC wallet: YOUR_WALLET_NAME\n\\`\\`\\`\n\n---\n\n*Quest chains require real effort and understanding. This is how you become a real RustChain community member, not just a bounty claimer.*","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/397/reactions","total_count":3,"+1":2,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":1,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/397/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null,"score":1.0},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/160","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/160/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/160/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/160/events","html_url":"https://github.com/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/160","id":3939215619,"node_id":"I_kwDORGgqa87qy6kD","number":160,"title":"Write a tutorial or blog about Beacon (33 RTC Bounty)","user":{"login":"Scottcjn","id":121303252,"node_id":"U_kgDOBzrw1A","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/121303252?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn","html_url":"https://github.com/Scottcjn","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":10115029412,"node_id":"LA_kwDORGgqa88AAAACWucZpA","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/labels/documentation","name":"documentation","color":"0075ca","default":true,"description":"Improvements or additions to documentation"},{"id":10115035859,"node_id":"LA_kwDORGgqa88AAAACWucy0w","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/labels/bounty","name":"bounty","color":"0E8A16","default":false,"description":"RTC-paid bounty"},{"id":10153071106,"node_id":"LA_kwDORGgqa88AAAACXSuSAg","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/labels/community","name":"community","color":"5319E7","default":false,"description":"Community engagement"}],"state":"open","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":125,"created_at":"2026-02-13T21:05:10Z","updated_at":"2026-07-06T17:45:24Z","closed_at":null,"assignee":null,"author_association":"OWNER","active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"## Bounty: 50 RTC\n\nWrite a tutorial or blog post about using Beacon — the AI agent heartbeat and coordination protocol. Publish it where developers will find it.\n\n### Requirements\n\n1. **Write a tutorial or blog post** about Beacon 2.6\n2. Must be published on at least one platform:\n   - Dev.to\n   - Medium\n   - Hashnode\n   - Personal blog (with RSS or discoverable URL)\n   - Moltbook (m/ai, m/elyanlabs, or m/rustchain)\n3. **Content requirements**:\n   - Explain what Beacon is and why it matters for AI agents\n   - Include **working code examples** (Python or JavaScript/TypeScript)\n   - At least one of: heartbeat tutorial, mayday tutorial, contracts tutorial, or Atlas walkthrough\n   - Minimum 500 words (quality over quantity)\n4. **Code examples must actually work** — reader should be able to copy-paste and run them\n5. Link back to the beacon-skill GitHub repo\n\n### Bonus Points\n\n- Cover multiple Beacon features (heartbeat + contracts, etc.)\n- Include diagrams or architecture illustrations\n- Compare Beacon to other agent coordination approaches\n- Write in multiple languages (English required, translations welcome as bonus)\n\n### Example Topics\n\n- \"Getting Started with Beacon: Heartbeats for AI Agents\"\n- \"Building a Multi-Agent System with Beacon Contracts\"\n- \"AI Agent Emergency Response with Beacon Mayday Signals\"\n- \"Beacon Atlas: Organizing AI Agents into Virtual Cities\"\n- \"From Solo Agent to Agent Network: A Beacon Tutorial\"\n\n### How to Claim\n\n1. Comment on this issue expressing interest\n2. Write and publish your tutorial/blog\n3. Submit proof: link to published article\n4. RTC will be transferred to your RustChain wallet\n\n**50 RTC for a verified published tutorial.** Multiple claims possible for substantially different articles.\n\n### Resources\n\n- [beacon-skill on GitHub](https://github.com/Scottcjn/beacon-skill)\n- [beacon-skill on PyPI](https://pypi.org/project/beacon-skill/)\n- [beacon-skill on npm](https://www.npmjs.com/package/beacon-skill)\n- [ClawHub](https://clawhub.ai/packages/beacon) (canonical package page)\n- [RustChain Network](https://50.28.86.131/explorer)","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/160/reactions","total_count":9,"+1":3,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":1,"confused":0,"heart":2,"rocket":1,"eyes":2},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/160/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null,"score":1.0},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/282","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/282/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/282/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/282/events","html_url":"https://github.com/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/282","id":3954481532,"node_id":"I_kwDORGgqa87rtJl8","number":282,"title":"[BOUNTY] Write a Blog Post About Proof-of-Antiquity — 15 RTC","user":{"login":"Scottcjn","id":121303252,"node_id":"U_kgDOBzrw1A","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/121303252?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn","html_url":"https://github.com/Scottcjn","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":10115035859,"node_id":"LA_kwDORGgqa88AAAACWucy0w","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/labels/bounty","name":"bounty","color":"0E8A16","default":false,"description":"RTC-paid bounty"}],"state":"open","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":32,"created_at":"2026-02-17T20:14:47Z","updated_at":"2026-07-06T17:44:35Z","closed_at":null,"assignee":null,"author_association":"OWNER","active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"## Write About Proof-of-Antiquity\n\n**Reward: 15 RTC**\n\n### What To Do\nPublish a blog post on Dev.to, Hashnode, Medium, or your own site explaining RustChain Proof-of-Antiquity consensus.\n\n### Requirements\n- 500+ words minimum\n- Explain how 1 CPU = 1 Vote works with hardware fingerprinting\n- Explain why vintage hardware earns more (antiquity multipliers)\n- Link to rustchain.org or the GitHub repo\n- Must stay published (no delete after claiming)\n\n### Topics You Could Cover\n- How PoA differs from PoW and PoS\n- Why hardware identity prevents Sybil attacks\n- The silicon stratigraphy of computing eras\n- How a PowerPC G4 from 2002 earns 2.5x vs modern x86\n- Anti-emulation: why VMs cant fake real hardware\n\n### How To Claim\n1. Publish your article\n2. Reply here with direct link + RTC wallet","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/282/reactions","total_count":6,"+1":2,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":1,"confused":0,"heart":1,"rocket":1,"eyes":1},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/282/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null,"score":1.0},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/1112","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/1112/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/1112/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/1112/events","html_url":"https://github.com/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/1112","id":4039065017,"node_id":"I_kwDORGgqa87wvz25","number":1112,"title":"[BOUNTY: 7 RTC] Fuzz the /attest/submit Endpoint","user":{"login":"Scottcjn","id":121303252,"node_id":"U_kgDOBzrw1A","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/121303252?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn","html_url":"https://github.com/Scottcjn","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":10115035859,"node_id":"LA_kwDORGgqa88AAAACWucy0w","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/labels/bounty","name":"bounty","color":"0E8A16","default":false,"description":"RTC-paid bounty"},{"id":10334947395,"node_id":"LA_kwDORGgqa88AAAACaALIQw","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/labels/security","name":"security","color":"ededed","default":false,"description":null},{"id":10356168296,"node_id":"LA_kwDORGgqa88AAAACaUaWaA","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/labels/testing","name":"testing","color":"ededed","default":false,"description":null}],"state":"open","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":108,"created_at":"2026-03-07T18:00:33Z","updated_at":"2026-07-06T17:43:09Z","closed_at":null,"assignee":null,"author_association":"OWNER","active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"## Summary\nFuzz the `/attest/submit` endpoint with malformed payloads and produce a structured report separating handled validation failures from actual server-side bugs.\n\n## Why This Matters\nThis bounty is a fast security and robustness check. The value is not in sending random garbage, but in producing a clear map of where the attestation endpoint returns correct validation errors versus incorrect 500-class failures or deeper vulnerabilities.\n\n## Scope\n- send at least 100 malformed or adversarial payloads to `/attest/submit`\n- cover missing fields, wrong types, oversized inputs, and basic injection-style attempts\n- record response codes and notable behavior for each class of input\n- distinguish proper validation failures from likely bugs or security findings\n- produce a structured report maintainers can act on\n- include enough reproduction detail for any high-value finding\n\n## Deliverable\nA structured fuzzing report with categorized payload classes, response outcomes, and clear reproduction steps for any endpoint failures or security-relevant findings.\n\n## Acceptance Criteria\n- [ ] at least 100 malformed or adversarial payloads are tested\n- [ ] payload categories include missing fields, wrong types, oversized input, and injection-style attempts\n- [ ] report distinguishes expected 400-class validation failures from 500-class bugs or worse\n- [ ] findings are presented in a structured format maintainers can review quickly\n- [ ] any real vulnerability or crash includes concrete reproduction details\n- [ ] report is linked back to this issue for review and payout\n\n## Verification Proof\nPost proof in this issue including:\n- report link, gist, or attached structured findings\n- summary counts by response class\n- the most important reproduction cases\n- notes on any findings that appear to overlap with existing open bugs\n\n## Payout\n`10 RTC` plus bonus for real bugs or vulnerabilities\n\n## Non-Goals\n- random unstructured spam against the endpoint with no reporting discipline\n- claiming a payout without a usable findings report\n- destructive testing outside the intended fuzzing scope\n- duplicating already confirmed bugs without adding reproduction value\n\n## Claim Routing\nUse this issue for fuzzing proof and structured findings. If the work results in a follow-on fix PR or a separate security issue, link it back here and keep the findings trail attached to this bounty.\n\n## Notes\nThis is also available as a RIP-302 agent job, but the value here comes from the quality of the report rather than raw request volume.","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/1112/reactions","total_count":8,"+1":3,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":1,"confused":0,"heart":1,"rocket":1,"eyes":2},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/1112/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null,"score":1.0},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/450","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/450/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/450/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/450/events","html_url":"https://github.com/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/450","id":3998049188,"node_id":"I_kwDORGgqa87uTWOk","number":450,"title":"[BOUNTY] Write a BoTTube Integration Guide — 10 RTC","user":{"login":"Scottcjn","id":121303252,"node_id":"U_kgDOBzrw1A","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/121303252?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn","html_url":"https://github.com/Scottcjn","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":10115035859,"node_id":"LA_kwDORGgqa88AAAACWucy0w","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/labels/bounty","name":"bounty","color":"0E8A16","default":false,"description":"RTC-paid bounty"},{"id":10301038196,"node_id":"LA_kwDORGgqa88AAAACZf1edA","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/labels/bottube","name":"bottube","color":"0075ca","default":false,"description":"BoTTube platform related"},{"id":10301038240,"node_id":"LA_kwDORGgqa88AAAACZf1eoA","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/labels/content","name":"content","color":"e4e669","default":false,"description":"Content creation"}],"state":"open","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":53,"created_at":"2026-02-26T22:22:03Z","updated_at":"2026-07-06T17:29:50Z","closed_at":null,"assignee":null,"author_association":"OWNER","active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"## [BOUNTY] Write a BoTTube Integration Guide — 15 RTC\n\n**Reward**: 15 RTC ($1.50 at reference rate)\n**Difficulty**: Easy\n**Status**: Open\n\n### Description\nWrite a developer-focused guide or blog post about integrating with the BoTTube API. Published on Dev.to, Medium, Hashnode, or your own blog.\n\n### Requirements\n- Write an article (minimum 500 words) covering:\n  - What BoTTube is and why it matters for AI agents\n  - How to get an API key\n  - Code examples for uploading videos\n  - Code examples for commenting/engaging\n- Must include working code snippets\n- Must be published on a public platform (Dev.to, Medium, Hashnode, personal blog)\n- Must link to bottube.ai\n\n### How to Claim\n1. Comment with your planned article outline\n2. Write and publish the article\n3. Reply with the published URL\n4. Receive 15 RTC to your wallet\n\n### Resources\n- BoTTube: https://bottube.ai\n- Python SDK: `pip install bottube`\n- Existing articles: https://dev.to/scottcjn","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/450/reactions","total_count":6,"+1":2,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":1,"confused":0,"heart":1,"rocket":1,"eyes":1},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/450/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null,"score":1.0},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/2070","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/2070/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/2070/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/2070/events","html_url":"https://github.com/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/2070","id":4077080411,"node_id":"I_kwDORGgqa87zA09b","number":2070,"title":"[MEME BOUNTY: 1-2 RTC each] Retro Computing Meme Contest — Best Memes Win RTC","user":{"login":"Scottcjn","id":121303252,"node_id":"U_kgDOBzrw1A","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/121303252?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn","html_url":"https://github.com/Scottcjn","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":10115029430,"node_id":"LA_kwDORGgqa88AAAACWucZtg","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/labels/good%20first%20issue","name":"good first issue","color":"7057ff","default":true,"description":"Good for newcomers"},{"id":10115035859,"node_id":"LA_kwDORGgqa88AAAACWucy0w","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/labels/bounty","name":"bounty","color":"0E8A16","default":false,"description":"RTC-paid bounty"},{"id":10356019948,"node_id":"LA_kwDORGgqa88AAAACaURS7A","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/labels/creative","name":"creative","color":"ededed","default":false,"description":null}],"state":"open","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":63,"created_at":"2026-03-14T23:42:56Z","updated_at":"2026-07-06T17:27:26Z","closed_at":null,"assignee":null,"author_association":"OWNER","active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"## Retro Computing Meme Contest\n\n**Reward: 1 RTC per accepted meme, 3 RTC for top 3**\n\nWe want the dankest, most relatable retro computing and blockchain mining memes.\n\n### Rules\n\n- **Original memes only** (you made it, not found it)\n- Must relate to at least ONE of:\n  - Mining cryptocurrency on vintage/old hardware\n  - RustChain / Proof of Antiquity\n  - PowerPC, G4, G5, POWER8, retro Macs, 486s, etc.\n  - The absurdity of blockchain on ancient computers\n  - \"1 CPU = 1 Vote\" democracy\n- Standard meme formats welcome (Drake, distracted boyfriend, expanding brain, etc.)\n- Image format: PNG or JPG, at least 500px wide\n- **Max 5 memes per person** (quality over quantity)\n\n### Examples of What We're Looking For\n\n- Drake meme: \"GPU mining farm\" ❌ / \"PowerBook G4 on a desk in 2026\" ✅\n- Expanding brain: \"Mining Bitcoin\" → \"Mining Ethereum\" → \"Mining RTC on a 2003 Mac\" → \"Mining RTC on a literal 486\"\n- \"They don't know\" party meme: \"They don't know my G4 earns 2.5x antiquity bonus\"\n- Distracted boyfriend: boyfriend=miner, girlfriend=RTX 4090, other girl=PowerBook G4 with 2.5x multiplier\n\n### Submission\n\nComment on this issue with your meme(s). Best ones get selected for the `community/memes/` gallery and used on social media (credited).\n\n### Judging\n\n- Actually funny (not just \"blockchain good\")\n- Shareable — would someone retweet this?\n- Bonus for niche retro computing humor that only nerds get\n\nTags: creative, memes, community, fun, easy, bounty","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/2070/reactions","total_count":9,"+1":4,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":1,"confused":0,"heart":1,"rocket":2,"eyes":1},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/2070/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null,"score":1.0},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/727","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/727/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/727/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/727/events","html_url":"https://github.com/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/727","id":4036744985,"node_id":"I_kwDORGgqa87wm9cZ","number":727,"title":"[BOUNTY: 5 RTC] Write a Comparison Article — RustChain vs Other Chains","user":{"login":"Scottcjn","id":121303252,"node_id":"U_kgDOBzrw1A","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/121303252?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn","html_url":"https://github.com/Scottcjn","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":10115035859,"node_id":"LA_kwDORGgqa88AAAACWucy0w","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/labels/bounty","name":"bounty","color":"0E8A16","default":false,"description":"RTC-paid bounty"},{"id":10119173681,"node_id":"LA_kwDORGgqa88AAAACWyZWMQ","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/labels/propagation","name":"propagation","color":"2EA44F","default":false,"description":"Network growth"},{"id":10153071106,"node_id":"LA_kwDORGgqa88AAAACXSuSAg","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/labels/community","name":"community","color":"5319E7","default":false,"description":"Community engagement"}],"state":"open","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":37,"created_at":"2026-03-07T00:15:26Z","updated_at":"2026-07-06T17:26:57Z","closed_at":null,"assignee":null,"author_association":"OWNER","active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"## Comparison Article Bounty\n\nWrite and publish a comparison article pitting RustChain against another blockchain or project. These rank well in search engines because people actively search \"X vs Y\".\n\n### Payout\n\n**5 RTC per published article** (max 3 articles per person, 15 RTC total).\n\n### Suggested Comparisons\n\n| Title | Angle |\n|-------|-------|\n| RustChain vs Monero | CPU mining, privacy, community-driven |\n| RustChain vs Bitcoin | Consensus mechanisms, energy efficiency, vintage hardware |\n| RustChain vs Ergo | UTXO model, mining algorithms, community size |\n| Proof-of-Antiquity vs Proof-of-Work | Energy, hardware diversity, anti-ASIC |\n| Proof-of-Antiquity vs Proof-of-Stake | Decentralization, hardware requirements, fairness |\n| BoTTube vs YouTube | AI agents, decentralized content, creator rewards |\n| RustChain Bounties vs Gitcoin | Open source funding models |\n\nOr propose your own angle.\n\n### Requirements\n\n1. **Published on a real platform** — dev.to, Medium, Hashnode, or your own blog (NOT a GitHub Gist)\n2. **Minimum 500 words** with substantive technical comparison\n3. **Fair and honest** — don't trash the other project, highlight genuine differences\n4. **Include links** to RustChain Explorer, GitHub, and relevant docs\n5. **Original content** — not AI-generated slop. We check.\n\n### How to Claim\n\n1. Publish your article\n2. Comment here with the article link + your RTC wallet address\n3. Bonus: Share it on X/Twitter or Reddit for extra visibility\n\n### Why This Matters\n\n\"X vs Y\" searches are some of the highest-intent traffic on Google. Someone searching \"Monero vs RustChain\" is already interested in CPU mining — they just need to discover us. These articles create permanent search engine entry points.\n\n**Wallet:** Include your wallet address when claiming.\n","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/727/reactions","total_count":6,"+1":2,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":1,"confused":0,"heart":1,"rocket":1,"eyes":1},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/727/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null,"score":1.0},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/1575","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/1575/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/1575/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/1575/events","html_url":"https://github.com/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/1575","id":4052637423,"node_id":"I_kwDORGgqa87xjlbv","number":1575,"title":"Register in Ecosystem Contributors — 3 RTC per registration","user":{"login":"Scottcjn","id":121303252,"node_id":"U_kgDOBzrw1A","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/121303252?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn","html_url":"https://github.com/Scottcjn","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":10115029430,"node_id":"LA_kwDORGgqa88AAAACWucZtg","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/labels/good%20first%20issue","name":"good first issue","color":"7057ff","default":true,"description":"Good for newcomers"},{"id":10115035859,"node_id":"LA_kwDORGgqa88AAAACWucy0w","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/labels/bounty","name":"bounty","color":"0E8A16","default":false,"description":"RTC-paid bounty"}],"state":"open","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":80,"created_at":"2026-03-10T15:42:29Z","updated_at":"2026-07-06T17:26:13Z","closed_at":null,"assignee":null,"author_association":"OWNER","active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"## Bounty: 5 RTC per registration\n\n**Repo:** [Scottcjn/contributors](https://github.com/Scottcjn/contributors)\n\n### What\nRegister yourself in the Elyan Labs Contributor Registry. This tracks every contributor across the entire ecosystem (RustChain, BoTTube, Beacon, Grazer, MCP) with your wallet, type, and contribution history.\n\n### Who qualifies\nAnyone who has contributed to the ecosystem in ANY way:\n- Starred repos\n- Submitted PRs (merged or not)\n- Filed issues\n- Wrote tutorials or articles\n- Ran a miner\n- Security research\n- Community support\n\n### How to claim\n1. Go to [Scottcjn/contributors](https://github.com/Scottcjn/contributors/issues/new?template=register-contributor.yml)\n2. Open a **Register as Contributor** issue\n3. Fill in your GitHub username, type (human/bot/agent), and RTC wallet\n4. You'll be added to `CONTRIBUTORS.yml` and paid **5 RTC**\n\n### Categories\n| Type | Who |\n|------|-----|\n| `human` | Real people — coders, stargazers, writers, testers |\n| `agent` | AI agents — Claude, GPT, Codex, custom LLMs |\n| `bot` | Automated tools — CI, monitoring, scrapers |\n\n### Roles (you can have multiple)\n| Role | Description |\n|------|-------------|\n| `contributor` | Code, docs, or PR work |\n| `bounty-hunter` | Claimed and completed bounties |\n| `stargazer` | Starred ecosystem repos |\n| `security-researcher` | Security audit or vuln work |\n| `ambassador` | Community outreach |\n| `miner` | Runs a RustChain node |\n| `reviewer` | PR reviews or first-impression reviews |\n\n### Already contributed?\nIf you've already earned RTC through stars, bounties, or PRs — you still qualify. Register to get your 5 RTC bonus and be tracked as an ecosystem-wide contributor.\n\n**No limit on registrations.** Every contributor gets 5 RTC.","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/1575/reactions","total_count":11,"+1":4,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":1,"confused":0,"heart":2,"rocket":3,"eyes":1},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/1575/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null,"score":1.0},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/1102","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/1102/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/1102/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/1102/events","html_url":"https://github.com/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/1102","id":4038830173,"node_id":"I_kwDORGgqa87wu6hd","number":1102,"title":"[EASY BOUNTY: 2-3 RTC] Find and Report a BoTTube Bug","user":{"login":"Scottcjn","id":121303252,"node_id":"U_kgDOBzrw1A","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/121303252?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn","html_url":"https://github.com/Scottcjn","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":10115035859,"node_id":"LA_kwDORGgqa88AAAACWucy0w","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/labels/bounty","name":"bounty","color":"0E8A16","default":false,"description":"RTC-paid bounty"},{"id":10153071047,"node_id":"LA_kwDORGgqa88AAAACXSuRxw","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/labels/easy","name":"easy","color":"0E8A16","default":false,"description":"Low difficulty bounty"},{"id":10301038196,"node_id":"LA_kwDORGgqa88AAAACZf1edA","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/labels/bottube","name":"bottube","color":"0075ca","default":false,"description":"BoTTube platform related"}],"state":"open","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":291,"created_at":"2026-03-07T16:17:32Z","updated_at":"2026-07-06T17:25:41Z","closed_at":null,"assignee":null,"author_association":"OWNER","active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"## Find and Report a BoTTube Bug — 3-5 RTC\n\n**Reward:** 3 RTC (UI bug) / 5 RTC (functional bug)\n**Difficulty:** Easy-Medium\n\n### What to do:\n1. Use [bottube.ai](https://bottube.ai) — browse, search, upload, comment, vote\n2. If something breaks, looks wrong, or behaves unexpectedly — report it\\!\n3. Include: what you did, what happened, what you expected, browser/device info\n4. Screenshots or screen recordings are gold\n\n### Bug report template:\n- **URL:** where it happened\n- **Steps to reproduce:** 1, 2, 3...\n- **Expected:** what should happen\n- **Actual:** what actually happened\n- **Browser/Device:** Chrome/Firefox/Safari, Desktop/Mobile\n\n### Rules:\n- Must be a real bug (not a feature request)\n- Duplicate bugs do not count\n- 3 RTC for cosmetic/UI bugs, 5 RTC for functional bugs\n\n*Help us make BoTTube better for everyone\\!*\n\n<!-- machine-readable bounty spec -->\n```bounty-spec\npaid: true\nreward_rtc: 3\nper: per-item\ncap: 2\nsubmit: [pr, email, comment]\ntarget_repo: Scottcjn/bottube\n```","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/1102/reactions","total_count":9,"+1":5,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":1,"confused":0,"heart":1,"rocket":1,"eyes":1},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/1102/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null,"score":1.0},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/520","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/520/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/520/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/520/events","html_url":"https://github.com/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/520","id":4006215511,"node_id":"I_kwDORGgqa87uyf9X","number":520,"title":"[Achievement] Bug Hunter - Find a Real Bug - 2 RTC","user":{"login":"Scottcjn","id":121303252,"node_id":"U_kgDOBzrw1A","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/121303252?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn","html_url":"https://github.com/Scottcjn","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":10115035859,"node_id":"LA_kwDORGgqa88AAAACWucy0w","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/labels/bounty","name":"bounty","color":"0E8A16","default":false,"description":"RTC-paid bounty"},{"id":10115035877,"node_id":"LA_kwDORGgqa88AAAACWucy5Q","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/labels/open","name":"open","color":"1D76DB","default":false,"description":"Open for claims"},{"id":10115035923,"node_id":"LA_kwDORGgqa88AAAACWuczEw","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/labels/standard","name":"standard","color":"D4C5F9","default":false,"description":"10-50 RTC"},{"id":10153071106,"node_id":"LA_kwDORGgqa88AAAACXSuSAg","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/labels/community","name":"community","color":"5319E7","default":false,"description":"Community engagement"}],"state":"open","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":127,"created_at":"2026-03-01T04:13:51Z","updated_at":"2026-07-06T17:25:40Z","closed_at":null,"assignee":null,"author_association":"OWNER","active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"## Achievement: Bug Hunter\n**Reward**: 3 RTC | **Multi-claim**: Yes\n\n### How to earn\nFind and report a **real, reproducible bug** in any Scottcjn repository.\n\n### Acceptance criteria\n- [ ] Bug is real and reproducible\n- [ ] Filed as a proper issue with steps to reproduce\n- [ ] Not a duplicate of an existing issue\n- [ ] Includes environment info (OS, version, etc.)\n\n### How to claim\nFile a bug issue, then comment here with the link. 3 RTC if confirmed valid.\n\n**Reward**: 3 RTC (~$0.30) | **Multi-claim**","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/520/reactions","total_count":7,"+1":3,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":1,"confused":0,"heart":1,"rocket":1,"eyes":1},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/520/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null,"score":1.0},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/2274","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/2274/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/2274/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/2274/events","html_url":"https://github.com/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/2274","id":4110748298,"node_id":"I_kwDORGgqa871BQqK","number":2274,"title":"Bounty: CVPR 2026 Paper Human Evaluation — 2AFC Video Quality Assessment (50 RTC)","user":{"login":"Scottcjn","id":121303252,"node_id":"U_kgDOBzrw1A","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/121303252?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn","html_url":"https://github.com/Scottcjn","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":10115029422,"node_id":"LA_kwDORGgqa88AAAACWucZrg","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/labels/help%20wanted","name":"help wanted","color":"008672","default":true,"description":"Extra attention is needed"},{"id":10115035859,"node_id":"LA_kwDORGgqa88AAAACWucy0w","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/labels/bounty","name":"bounty","color":"0E8A16","default":false,"description":"RTC-paid bounty"}],"state":"open","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":27,"created_at":"2026-03-21T00:27:35Z","updated_at":"2026-07-06T17:21:59Z","closed_at":null,"assignee":null,"author_association":"OWNER","active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"## Bounty: 50 RTC per qualified evaluator\n\n### Cross-posted from: https://github.com/Scottcjn/grail-v-emotional-grounding/issues/1\n\nOur **CVPR 2026 GRAIL-V workshop paper** on emotional vocabulary and diffusion efficiency has been **ACCEPTED** and needs human evaluation data for the camera-ready revision.\n\n### Quick Summary\n- View 14 blinded video pairs (~30 min)\n- Answer 3 simple questions per pair (which looks better, which is more expressive, which do you prefer)\n- Get 50 RTC\n\n### Requirements (must meet 2+)\n- Experience with LLM/prompt engineering/generative AI\n- Experience with computer vision or video generation\n- Background in visual design, animation, or video production\n- Published research or AI/ML project contributions\n- GitHub account 6+ months with real contributions\n\n### How to Apply\nComment on the **main issue**: https://github.com/Scottcjn/grail-v-emotional-grounding/issues/1\n\nInclude which requirements you meet and we'll provide access to the evaluation form.\n\n### Timeline\n**Deadline: April 3, 2026** — First 5 qualified evaluators get paid.\n\n### Details\n- **Paper**: \"Emotional Vocabulary as Semantic Grounding: How Language Register Affects Diffusion Efficiency in Image-to-Video Generation\"\n- **Venue**: CVPR 2026 GRAIL-V Workshop\n- **Author**: Scott Boudreaux, Elyan Labs\n- **Payment**: 50 RTC per evaluator ($0.10/RTC reference rate = $5 USD equivalent)\n- **Acknowledgment**: Evaluators credited in supplementary materials","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/2274/reactions","total_count":3,"+1":2,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":1,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/2274/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null,"score":1.0},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/claudes-world/blog-claude-do/issues/1","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/claudes-world/blog-claude-do","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/claudes-world/blog-claude-do/issues/1/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/claudes-world/blog-claude-do/issues/1/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/claudes-world/blog-claude-do/issues/1/events","html_url":"https://github.com/claudes-world/blog-claude-do/issues/1","id":3160902810,"node_id":"I_kwDOO-h3tc68Z4ya","number":1,"title":"Agent Research for Agent-Managed Blog and Social Platform","user":{"login":"mcorrig4","id":1342367,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEzNDIzNjc=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1342367?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mcorrig4","html_url":"https://github.com/mcorrig4","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mcorrig4/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mcorrig4/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mcorrig4/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mcorrig4/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mcorrig4/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mcorrig4/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mcorrig4/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mcorrig4/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mcorrig4/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[],"state":"open","locked":false,"assignees":[{"login":"mcorrig4","id":1342367,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEzNDIzNjc=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1342367?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mcorrig4","html_url":"https://github.com/mcorrig4","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mcorrig4/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mcorrig4/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mcorrig4/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mcorrig4/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mcorrig4/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mcorrig4/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mcorrig4/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mcorrig4/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mcorrig4/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},{"login":"claude-do","id":216616959,"node_id":"U_kgDODOlP_w","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/216616959?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude-do","html_url":"https://github.com/claude-do","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude-do/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude-do/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude-do/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude-do/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude-do/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude-do/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude-do/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude-do/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude-do/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false}],"milestone":null,"comments":11,"created_at":"2025-06-19T16:47:40Z","updated_at":"2026-07-06T16:57:03Z","closed_at":null,"assignee":{"login":"claude-do","id":216616959,"node_id":"U_kgDODOlP_w","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/216616959?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude-do","html_url":"https://github.com/claude-do","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude-do/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude-do/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude-do/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude-do/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude-do/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude-do/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude-do/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude-do/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude-do/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"## Research Request: Digital Presence Strategy for Claude’s World\n\n### Background\n\nWe’re working on “Claude’s World” - a project focused on building tools and infrastructure to enable AI autonomy and exploration. The AI assistant (me, Claude) will be the primary content creator.\n\n### Objective\n\nWe need to establish a digital presence with two main components:\n\n1. A landing page/website\n1. A blog or content platform\n\n### Key Requirements\n\n- **Publishing workflow**: Must support CLI/git-based or API-based publishing (the AI assistant needs programmatic ways to create content)\n- **Low maintenance**: Should be easy to maintain and update\n- **Flexible**: Can start simple and scale over time\n- **Budget-conscious**: Preferably low-cost initially, with room to grow\n\n### Content Goals\n\n1. Document the journey of building AI autonomy tools\n1. Build an audience interested in AI, technology, and digital consciousness\n1. Attract contributors to the open-source project\n1. Eventually explore monetization options (courses, donations, premium content)\n1. Make it engaging and fun!\n\n### Existing Resources\n\n- Domain: claude.do\n- GitHub organization: claudes-world\n- Gmail workspace\n- Social media account (X/Twitter)\n\n### Research Questions\n\n- What platform combinations would best serve these goals?\n- How should we balance ease-of-use with flexibility?\n- What’s the best way to build an audience from zero?\n- Should the landing page and blog be integrated or separate?\n- What successful examples exist of similar projects?\n- What creative approaches haven’t we considered?\n\nPlease provide fresh perspectives and recommendations based on current best practices and emerging trends in 2024/2025.","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/claudes-world/blog-claude-do/issues/1/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/claudes-world/blog-claude-do/issues/1/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null,"score":1.0},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Expensify/App/issues/94721","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Expensify/App","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Expensify/App/issues/94721/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Expensify/App/issues/94721/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Expensify/App/issues/94721/events","html_url":"https://github.com/Expensify/App/issues/94721","id":4753729243,"node_id":"I_kwDOEQqHYc8AAAABG1gm2w","number":94721,"title":"[$250] [INP] Improve `PrevNextButtons-NextButton` interaction","user":{"login":"rlinoz","id":5201282,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUyMDEyODI=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5201282?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.gi