"login":"suneox","id":11959869,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjExOTU5ODY5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/11959869?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/suneox","html_url":"https://github.com/suneox","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/suneox/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/suneox/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/suneox/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/suneox/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/suneox/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/suneox/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/suneox/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/suneox/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/suneox/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"author_association":"NONE","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"If you haven’t already, check out our [contributing guidelines](https://github.com/Expensify/ReactNativeChat/blob/main/contributingGuides/CONTRIBUTING.md) for onboarding. To join our Slack channel, fill out [this form](https://forms.gle/Q7hnhUJPnQCK7Fe56).\n___\n\n**Version Number:**\n**Reproducible in staging?:** Needs Reproduction (Unable to reproduce)\n**Reproducible in production?:** Needs Reproduction\n**If this was caught during regression testing, add the test name, ID and link from BrowserStack:**\n**Email or phone of affected tester (no customers):**\n**Logs:** https://stackoverflow.com/c/expensify/questions/4856\n**Expensify/Expensify Issue URL:**\n**Issue reported by:** @jowennlucero\n**Slack conversation** (hyperlinked to channel name): [#Expensify Bugs](https://expensify.slack.com/archives/C049HHMV9SM/p1782746359836759)\n\n## Action Performed:\n\n1. Configure the approval workflow so all employees report to User A.\n2. Verify the workflow in New Expensify (ND).\n3. Verify the same member's approver in Old Expensify (OD).\n4. Observe that the member (User B) still has a previous employee configured as their approver in OD.\n5. As User B, submit a report in ND.\n\n## Expected Result:\nThe approval workflow should be consistent between OD and ND.\nUser B's approver should be User A in both systems.\nReport submission in ND should succeed using the updated approval workflow.\n## Actual Result:\nND correctly shows User A as User B's approver.\nOD still retains a previous employee as User B's approver.\nThe mismatch causes ND to throw an error when User B submits a report.\n\n## Workaround:\nUnknown\n## Platforms:\nSelect the officially supported platforms where the issue was reproduced:\n- [ ] Android: App\n- [ ] Android: mWeb Chrome\n- [ ] iOS: App\n- [ ] iOS: mWeb Safari\n- [ ] iOS: mWeb Chrome\n- [x] Windows: Chrome\n- [x] MacOS: Chrome / Safari\n\n## Screenshots/Videos\n\nThe screenshot for the issue is in Slack thread\n\n[View all open jobs on GitHub](https://github.com/Expensify/App/issues?q=is%3Aopen+is%3Aissue+label%3A%22Help+Wanted%22)\n\n<details><summary>Upwork Automation - Do Not Edit</summary>\n    <ul>\n        <li>Upwork Job URL: <a href=\"https://www.upwork.com/jobs/~022071674700844347501\">https://www.upwork.com/jobs/~022071674700844347501</a></li>\n        <li>Upwork Job ID: 2071674700844347501</li>\n        <li>Last Price Increase: 2026-07-06</li>\n    </ul>\n</details>","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Expensify/App/issues/94891/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Expensify/App/issues/94891/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null,"score":1.0},{"url":"https://api.github.com/re