l":"https://api.github.com/repos/zhangjiayang6835-cyber/ai-research/labels/bounty","name":"bounty","color":"00ff00","default":false,"description":"赏金任务"},{"id":11374970479,"node_id":"LA_kwDOTGNm188AAAACpgBGbw","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/zhangjiayang6835-cyber/ai-research/labels/security","name":"security","color":"ededed","default":false,"description":null},{"id":11378455837,"node_id":"LA_kwDOTGNm188AAAACpjV1HQ","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/zhangjiayang6835-cyber/ai-research/labels/expert","name":"expert","color":"ededed","default":false,"description":null}],"state":"open","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":4,"created_at":"2026-07-06T00:00:35Z","updated_at":"2026-07-06T06:29:52Z","closed_at":null,"assignee":null,"author_association":"OWNER","active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"## 🐛 Bug Bounty: Reentrancy Attack on DeFi Withdraw Function\n\n**难度:** Expert | **奖励:** $100 USD\n\n### 漏洞描述\n此漏洞描述了一个常见的安全问题: Reentrancy Attack on DeFi Withdraw Function。需要提交修复代码。\n\n### 提交要求\n- 提交修复代码（Python/JavaScript）\n- 在 issue 评论中以代码块形式提交\n- 也可以创建 Pull Request\n\n### 评估标准\n- 代码正确修复了安全漏洞\n- 没有引入新的安全问题\n- 代码简洁且有效\n\n---\n*任务由 Daily Task Generator 自动创建*","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/zhangjiayang6835-cyber/ai-research/issues/432/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/zhangjiayang6835-cyber/ai-research/issues/432/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null,"score":1.0},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ilan-WS/prudence-fork/issues/37","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ilan-WS/prudence-fork","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ilan-WS/prudence-fork/issues/37/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.