ull,"assignee":null,"author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"## WS-2016-0075 - Medium Severity Vulnerability\n<details><summary><img src='https://whitesource-resources.whitesourcesoftware.com/vulnerability_details.png' width=19 height=20> Vulnerable Library - <b>github.com/tdewolff/Minify/v2-v2.9.21</b></summary>\n\n<p>Go minifiers for web formats</p>\n<p>Library home page: <a href=\"https://proxy.golang.org/github.com/tdewolff/minify/v2/@⁠v/v2.9.21.zip\">https://proxy.golang.org/github.com/tdewolff/minify/v2/@⁠v/v2.9.21.zip</a></p>\n<p>Path to dependency file: /go.mod</p>\n<p>Path to vulnerable library: /go.mod</p>\n<p>\n\nDependency Hierarchy:\n  - :x: **github.com/tdewolff/Minify/v2-v2.9.21** (Vulnerable Library)\n<p>Found in base branch: <b>main</b></p>\n</p>\n</details>\n<p></p>\n<details><summary><img src='https://whitesource-resources.whitesourcesoftware.com/medium_vul.png?' width=19 height=20> Vulnerability Details</summary>\n<p>  \n  \nRegular expression denial of service vulnerability in the moment package, by using a specific 40 characters long string in the \"format\" method. \n\n<p>Publish Date: 2026-05-19\n<p>URL: <a href=https://redirect.github.com/moment/moment/pull/3525>WS-2016-0075</a></p>\n</p>\n</details>\n<p></p>\n<details><summary><img src='https://whitesource-resources.whitesourcesoftware.com/cvss3.png' width=19 height=20> CVSS 3 Score Details (<b>5.3</b>)</summary>\n<p>\n\nBase Score Metrics:\n- Exploitability Metrics:\n  - Attack Vector: Network\n  - Attack Complexity: Low\n  - Privileges Required: None\n  - User Interaction: None\n  - Scope: Unchanged\n- Impact Metrics:\n  - Confidentiality Impact: None\n  - Integrity Impact: None\n  - Availability Impact: Low\n</p>\nFor more information on CVSS3 Scores, click <a href=\"https://www.first.org/cvss/calculator/3.0\">here</a>.\n</p>\n</details>\n<p></p>\n<details><summary><img src='https://whitesource-resources.whitesourcesoftware.com/suggested_fix.png' width=19 height=20> Suggested Fix</summary>\n<p>\n\n<p>Type: Upgrade version</p>\n<p>Release Date: 2016-10-24</p>\n<p>Fix Resolution: moment - 2.15.2,wpanel/wpanel4-cms - no_fix,puresolcom/polyether - no_fix,nystudio107/retour - 1.0.14,websecret/panel - 2.0.1,kba-team/cakephp-adminlte-theme - 1.1.0,genix/cms - v1.1.2,mautic/core - dev-fix-company-import-error-without-unique-field,sevenpointsix/ctrl - no_fix,server2 - no_fix,gerizal/core-module - dev-feature,nuradev/nura24 - no_fix,chill-project/chill-bundles - dev-permission-page/modernize,thiagotalma/yii2-fullcalendar - dev-FC_v2.2.6,snowleopard/administration - no_fix,laraflock/dashboard - 1.0.x-dev,asgardcms/adminlte-theme - no_fix,zijinghua-dev/voyager - 0.1.x-dev,lilweb/job-bundle - dev-rabbit-mq,yinheark/yincart2 - no_fix,chill-project/chill-bundles - dev-fix/accompanying_period-work-creation-date,snipe/snipe-it - dev-fixes/support_apache_24,phifty/corebundle - 2.11.0,treo/treopim - v1.12.10,sierratecnologia/templeiro - no_fix,mautic/core - dev-all-contributors/add-johbuch,chill-project/chill-bundles - dev-undeprecate/repository-by-fqdn-only,imagina/adminimagina - no_fix,moment.js - 2.14.2,griffyn/voyager - 1.x-dev,scylabs/neptune-bundle - v1.0.4,flickerleap/cakephp-adminlte-theme - no_fix,diandiyun/ddicms - 1.0.3,ans.mvc5.moment2 - no_fix,oidnus/admin-theme-bundle - no_fix,yab/quarx - v2.3.18,moment.js - 2.13.0,coandacms/coanda-core - no_fix,darekmeco/platform - no_fix,soda-framework/cms - 0.3.1,christopherney/crudbooster - v5.3.1.4.1,wyyr/crudbooster - no_fix,moeen1/helpsupport - no_fix,bruensicke/radium - dev-feature/twbs3,cupboard/core - no_fix,xsoft/adminpanel - no_fix,mathsgod/alt - 5.6.136,iamthom/cakephp-adminlte-theme - no_fix,globesol/globeadmin - 1.8.0,charliesolutions/crudbooster - dev-CHR-55-select-research-bar-suivi-materiel,treo/treopim - 3.20